---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms & Conditions — The Weekend Read" 
  description="Read the terms and conditions for utilizing The Weekend Read link-saver and weekly newsletter platform."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-mute uppercase">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="font-sans font-semibold text-4xl tracking-tight text-primary mt-1">Terms of Service.</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-mute font-mono mt-2">Last updated: June 5, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-body text-sm leading-relaxed font-sans border-t border-hairline pt-10">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg text-primary tracking-tight mb-3">1. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          By signing up for The Weekend Read, you agree to use our service for personal link saving and article reading. You may not:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li>Utilize the platform to store malicious links, phishing sites, or dangerous content.</li>
          <li>Script, scrape, or perform automated spam submissions to the database.</li>
          <li>Attempt to compromise the security of other users' dashboards.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg text-primary tracking-tight mb-3">2. Account Responsibility</h2>
        <p>
          You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your authentication details via Clerk. We are not liable for any unauthorized access to your saved links resulting from compromised account keys or devices.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg text-primary tracking-tight mb-3">3. Service Availability</h2>
        <p>
          The Weekend Read is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. While we aim for 100% email delivery and database uptime, we are not liable for delayed digests or missing entries.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg text-primary tracking-tight mb-3">4. Modifications</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify or discontinue any part of the service at any time. Changes to terms will be updated directly on this page.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
